  "question": {
    "text": "If a function $\\mathbf{f}: \\mathbf{R}-\\{l\\} \\rightarrow \\mathbf{R}-\\{m\\}$ defined by $f(x)=\\frac{x+3}{x-2}$ is a bijection, then $3 l+2 m=$",
